  "description": "<p data-start=\"53\" data-end=\"435\">De <strong data-start=\"56\" data-end=\"69\">Oculus Go</strong> is een compacte en gebruiksvriendelijke <strong data-start=\"110\" data-end=\"132\">standalone VR-bril</strong> waarmee je direct kunt genieten van virtual reality, zonder pc of externe sensoren. Ideaal voor VR-video’s, games en 360°-content. Dankzij het lichte ontwerp en de eenvoudige installatie is de Oculus Go perfect voor zowel beginners als casual VR-gebruikers die snel willen instappen in virtual reality.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"437\" data-end=\"512\">De VR-bril verkeert in <strong data-start=\"460\" data-end=\"478\">In Nette Staat</strong> en is technisch volledig in orde.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"514\" data-end=\"517\">\r\n<p data-start=\"519\" data-end=\"534\">⭐ <strong data-start=\"521\" data-end=\"534\">Voordelen</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"535\" data-end=\"717\">\r\n<li data-start=\"535\" data-end=\"581\">\r\n<p data-start=\"537\" data-end=\"581\">🥽 Standalone VR: geen pc of console nodig</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"582\" data-end=\"634\">\r\n<p data-start=\"584\" data-end=\"634\">🎮 Toegankelijke VR-ervaring voor games en media</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"635\" data-end=\"682\">\r\n<p data-start=\"637\" data-end=\"682\">🎬 Geschikt voor VR-video’s en 360°-content</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"683\" data-end=\"717\">\r\n<p data-start=\"685\" data-end=\"717\">✋ Licht en comfortabel ontwerp</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"719\" data-end=\"722\">\r\n<p data-start=\"724\" data-end=\"744\">📋 <strong data-start=\"727\" data-end=\"744\">Specificaties</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"745\" data-end=\"927\">\r\n<li data-start=\"745\" data-end=\"761\">\r\n<p data-start=\"747\" data-end=\"761\">Merk: Oculus</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"762\" data-end=\"775\">\r\n<p data-start=\"764\" data-end=\"775\">Model: Go</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"776\" data-end=\"804\">\r\n<p data-start=\"778\" data-end=\"804\">Type: Standalone VR-bril</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"805\" data-end=\"821\">\r\n<p data-start=\"807\" data-end=\"821\">Opslag: 32GB</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"822\" data-end=\"848\">\r\n<p data-start=\"824\" data-end=\"848\">Resolutie: 2560 × 1440</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"849\" data-end=\"884\">\r\n<p data-start=\"851\" data-end=\"884\">Connectiviteit: WiFi, Bluetooth</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"885\" data-end=\"901\">\r\n<p data-start=\"887\" data-end=\"901\">Kleur: Grijs</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"902\" data-end=\"927\">\r\n<p data-start=\"904\" data-end=\"927\">Staat: In Nette Staat</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"929\" data-end=\"932\">\r\n<p data-start=\"934\" data-end=\"952\">📦 <strong data-start=\"937\" data-end=\"952\">Meegeleverd</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"953\" data-end=\"1005\">\r\n<li data-start=\"953\" data-end=\"974\">\r\n<p data-start=\"955\" data-end=\"974\">Oculus Go VR-bril</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"975\" data-end=\"989\">\r\n<p data-start=\"977\" data-end=\"989\">Controller</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"990\" data-end=\"1005\">\r\n<p data-start=\"992\" data-end=\"1005\">Oplaadkabel</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1007\" data-end=\"1010\">\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1012\" data-end=\"1075\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">🛡️ <strong data-start=\"1016\" data-end=\"1034\">Incl. Garantie</strong><br data-start=\"1034\" data-end=\"1037\">Incl. Garantie: <strong data-start=\"1053\" data-end=\"1075\" data-is-last-node=\"\">3 maanden garantie</strong></p>",
